This course aims to:
Optimize your learning experience in the IMBA Program through self-reflection on the purpose of the graduate study;
Enhance self-understanding and social competencies through partnership building in your IMBA journey;
Re-orientate your understanding of learning, especially in the importance of developing oneself and others in the context of good leadership and followership;
Understand the power of transformational leadership, and the keys to competent leadership and followership;
Understand the concepts of teaming and the process of building high- performance teams;
Recognize and appreciate the importance of diversity and cross-cultural competencies;
Construct your life vision and short-term plans for your journey in IMBA, and long-term plans for your future career and life.

Upon completion of the course, students should be able to:
Demonstrate an understanding of key concepts and theories related to teaching English vocabulary in second and foreign language contexts;
Analyze, adapt, and design vocabulary teaching materials, classroom tasks, and assessment tools based on the theoretical concepts and pedagogical frameworks introduced in the course;
Develop research questions related to vocabulary teaching and learning in EFL contexts.

grading:
研究報告(50%):這是一份類似碩士論文大綱,不少於4,500字的期末報告,由同學獨立完成。這份報告都需要包含研究問題(背景與重要性)、不少於5篇學術期刊文章、專書或是專章的文獻檢閱、要使用的研究方法與資料蒐集方法(以及應用原因)、預期結果、研究進度、章節安排以及最後,文中所有資料的參考文獻等,並且包含了所有的圖、表、註釋,但是不含封面。這份報告的繳交時間初步訂為:2026年12月26日中午12點以前,上傳至Moodle平台,因學校批改作業時間與送交成績時間的規定,請勿遲交,超過時間者系統會自動拒收報告。參考文獻與註釋方式格式的編排,一律使用政治學類或是APA格式等撰寫,不得使用其他學門的註釋格式;
口頭報告(20%):我們會在本學期第15與16週,針對前述的研究報告進行約10±1分鐘的口頭報告;
團體與課程討論(30%):同學們應該閱讀本門課程的指定教材,並從必讀的文章之中至少選擇一篇研讀與充分參與討論。注意:應該要充分參與討論的意義在於對課程有貢獻、能夠發問或是回應同學的問題。

